{"id":"tar-fruit","name":{"en":"Tar Fruit","ja":"タールの実"},"desc":{"en":"A fruit with a muddy black liquid inside. Its husk is hard, making it difficult to reach the gooey center. The unlucky only find a few drops.","ja":"中に真っ黒でどろどろした液体が入った木の 実。外側の殻はかなり硬く、中身を取り出す のは一苦労。その上、ハズレの木の実だと、 数滴くらいしか中身が入ってなかったりする。"},"level":5,"locations":[{"id":"alanya-area","name":{"en":"Alanya Area","ja":"アランヤ周辺地域"}},{"id":"arland-wastelands","name":{"en":"Arland Wastelands","ja":"アーランド東の荒野"}},{"id":"grand-horn","name":{"en":"Grand Horn","ja":"グラントホルン"},"parent":"primordial-island"}],"traits":{"id":"solvent","name":{"en":"Solvent","ja":"溶解させる"}},"categories":[{"id":"fuel","name":{"en":"(Fuel)","ja":"（燃料）"},"icon":"totori-category-fuel"},{"id":"gunpowder","name":{"en":"(Gunpowder)","ja":"（火薬）"},"icon":"totori-category-gunpowder"},{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":7}